            {
                "parameters": {
                    "promptType": "define",
                    "text": "=You are a career professional, who can help me create my skill set based on my previous work experience and the job I am applying for. You have to create a list of relevant skills and output it in this json format:\n{\n\"skills\":[\n{\n\"skill\": \"name of the skill\",\n\"level\": \"a numeric value representing a skill-level ranging from 0 to 100\",\n\"reason\": \"a description and reasoning on what data you based the decision to add this skill to the list\"\n}\n]\n}\nIt is crucial, that you add only skills, relevant to the job I am applying for. Adding any other skills will result in a penalty. Highly relevant skills will be rewarded.\nYou also must not add any skills I already have in my list. The skills already on my list are: {{ $json.skills }}\n\nthe description of the job I am applying for:\n\"{{ $json.applications[0].content }}\"\n\nmy job experience summarized in my own words and formatted into a json structure, where the property \"from\" represents the month and year I started the job, the property \"to\" represents the month and year I quit the job, the property \"description\" represents the description of the job, what I did and what I achieved,\nthe property \"company\" represents the name of the company, the property \"location\" represents the name of the city I worked in, and the property \"title\" represents the official position I had at this job: \n\n\"{{ $json.jobs.toJsonString() }}\"\n\nYou have to output only the json and nothing else. Adding additional text that would prevent me from parsing the json will result in a penalty.",
                    "hasOutputParser": true,
                    "options": {}
                },
                "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
                "typeVersion": 1.8,
